Brand ai tasks that can be delegated
title end

paragraph start
Tasks that suit AI: name alternatives, caption drafts, contrast checks, file naming and mockup variations. Tasks that stay with a person: choosing the name, approving the logo, any factual claim and anything legal.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Delegate only a task that has a clear input, a clear output and a check a person can do quickly.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
task, delegate or keep, input, output, check
code end

paragraph start
todo: confirm the list and add tasks as they appear
Open until the owner decides.
paragraph end
